  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d95f71226bf26bc4caed6a0458a3b538, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lesson 9 Question 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  question: Since God is there to see all sins committed, what should you do?
  answers:
  - Keep on keeping on
  - Acknowledge our sin before God
  - Work really hard to make up for it
  - Hide from God
  correctAnswerIndex: 1
  discussionAnswer: Because God is always present and sees everyone's deeds, every
    person is responsible to acknowledge their sinfulness before God.  He already
    perfectly knows what you have done.
